bottomparticipants

actor Staff
boundary "Admin UI" as UI
boundary Router
control ReplyController
control ReplyService
entity ReplyModel
control AuditService
database MongoDB

Staff -> UI: 1. Click toggle reply visibility
activate Staff
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. PATCH /toggle/:id (JWT)
activate Router

Router -> ReplyController: 3. toggleReply(id, req)
activate ReplyController

ReplyController -> ReplyService: 4. toggleReplyVisibility(id, payload)
activate ReplyService

ReplyService -> ReplyModel: 5. findById(id)
activate ReplyModel
ReplyModel -> MongoDB: 6. findById
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ReplyModel: 7. reply / null
deactivate MongoDB
ReplyModel --> ReplyService: 8. result
deactivate ReplyModel

opt Reply not found
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 8.1 Throw BadRequestException
    ReplyController --> Router: 8.2 HTTP 400
    Router --> UI: 8.3 Error response
    UI --> Staff: 8.4 Reply does not exist
end

ReplyService -> ReplyService: 9. Toggle is_delete flag
activate ReplyService
space
deactivate ReplyService

ReplyService -> ReplyModel: 10. save()
activate ReplyModel
ReplyModel -> MongoDB: 11. update reply
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ReplyModel: 12. saved
deactivate MongoDB
ReplyModel --> ReplyService: 13. done
deactivate ReplyModel

ReplyService -> AuditService: 14. createLog(auditData)
activate AuditService
AuditService -> MongoDB: 15. insert audit log
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> AuditService: 16. saved
deactivate MongoDB
AuditService --> ReplyService: 17. done
deactivate AuditService

ReplyService --> ReplyController: 18. success result
deactivate ReplyService
ReplyController --> Router: 19. HTTP 200 + message
deactivate ReplyController
Router --> UI: 20. Success response
deactivate Router
UI --> Staff: 21. Show result message
deactivate UI
deactivate Staff
@enduml